[I] Declare version conflicts for your dist

[T] Dist::CheckConflicts lets a CPAN distribution declare versions of other
[T] modules it conflicts with, and checks them at install or load time to
[T] warn about incompatible combinations.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/Dist-CheckConflicts

